{
 "text": "Good morning. Today I would like to talk about the importance of learning a foreign language. In my opinion, learning English is not only useful for travel, but also for finding a job. You know, when I was at school, I found it very difficult to speak in public. However, with time, I became more confident. For example, last year, I gave a presentation in English at my school, and my teacher said that my pronunciation was much better than before. If I had continued practicing every day, I would have improved even faster. To sum up, I believe that everyone should learn at least one foreign language, because it opens new doors and helps us understand other people. Thank you for listening.",
 "duration_s": 46.03,
 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 0.68,
   "text": "Good morning."
  },
  {
   "start": 1.62,
   "end": 5.16,
   "text": "Today I would like to talk about the importance of learning a foreign language."
  },
  {
   "start": 5.9,
   "end": 11.58,
   "text": "In my opinion, learning English is not only useful for travel, but also for finding a job."
  },
  {
   "start": 12.62,
   "end": 16.52,
   "text": "You know, when I was at school, I found it very difficult to speak in public."
  },
  {
   "start": 17.82,
   "end": 20.68,
   "text": "However, with time, I became more confident."
  },
  {
   "start": 21.66,
   "end": 25.98,
   "text": "For example, last year, I gave a presentation in English at my school,"
  },
  {
   "start": 25.98,
   "end": 29.56,
   "text": "and my teacher said that my pronunciation was much better than before."
  },
  {
   "start": 30.34,
   "end": 34.66,
   "text": "If I had continued practicing every day, I would have improved even faster."
  },
  {
   "start": 35.7,
   "end": 39.42,
   "text": "To sum up, I believe that everyone should learn at least one foreign language,"
  },
  {
   "start": 39.84,
   "end": 43.06,
   "text": "because it opens new doors and helps us understand other people."
  },
  {
   "start": 43.76,
   "end": 45.0,
   "text": "Thank you for listening."
  }
 ],
